{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15947","headline":"寒食行 · 王建","name":"寒食行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒食家家出古城，老人看屋少年行。\n丘壠年年无旧道，车徒散行入衰草。\n牧儿驱牛下塚头，畏有家人来洒扫。\n远人无坟水头祭，还引妇姑望乡拜。\n三日无火烧纸钱，纸钱那得到黄泉。\n但看壠上无新土，此中白骨应无主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15947.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15947","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}